{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cg5dfhXAnHwTvwZZfiJiC","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"MATERIAL OBJECTION\n\n## (1) Fidelity to the seven converged amendments\n\n| # | Verdict |\n|---|---|\n| 1 Provenance tied to what this run received | Applied, with one material defect (Objection A) |\n| 2 Speaker labelled per sentence | Applied faithfully |\n| 3 Re-read sources before declaring a gap | Applied faithfully |\n| 4 Role string, edition, default credit rows, conflict scope | Applied, with a material distortion (Objection C) |\n| 5 Coverage numerator as track IDs | Applied faithfully |\n| 6 Length target for core prose only, no ritual repetition | Applied faithfully |\n| 7 General title/concept question; path types instead of outlets | The question is applied. The path wording narrows P0 (Objection B). |\n\n**Objection B (distortion of #7).** `- 공식 판매·스트리밍 앨범 페이지에 실린 아티스트 명의 성명` and `- 핵심 곡의 …·믹서의 작업 인터뷰` replace P0's general items. Statements published on the artist's own site or in a press release drop off the checklist. So do work explanations that aren't interviews. The amendment was meant to add path types, not shrink the list. It also echoes the pilot album's Apple Music statement.\nReplace with:\n`- 아티스트 명의 성명(공식 판매·스트리밍 앨범 페이지, 공식 웹사이트·보도자료 등)`\n`- 프로듀서·공동 작곡자·연주자·엔지니어·믹서의 작업 설명(핵심 곡의 기술 인터뷰 포함)`\n\n## (2) Scope creep and album-specific content\n\nThere is no scope creep. The Korean-output exception, the location format and the cross-run rule all come from A-10 and A-5, which are cited under #1. No outlet, service or album fact is named. Genius was already in P0.\n\n## (3) New defects\n\n**Objection A (status inflation, conflicts with an unchanged P0 rule).** `[원문 확인]은 이번 실행에서 그 URL의 본문을 실제로 받았고…` lets a fetched article that only re-quotes a statement count as `[직접 발언·원문 확인]`. That conflicts with P0's rule \"재인용 기사를 직접 열어봤다는 이유로 인터뷰 원본 확인으로 집계하지 않는다\".\nReplace with: `[원문 확인]은 이번 실행에서 그 진술이 처음 실린 URL의 본문을 실제로 받았고, 원문 언어로 된 최소 발췌가 부록에 있을 때만 쓴다. 재인용 기사의 본문만 받았으면 [재인용]이다.`\n\n**Objection C (spurious conflicts).** `같은 범위에서 어긋나면 [상충]으로 둔다.` is looser than the new §5 test, which requires the same object, role, time and scope. It also clashes with the unchanged rule \"크레딧이 없다는 사실만으로…\".\nReplace with: `같은 대상·역할·시점·범위에서 양립할 수 없을 때만 [상충]으로 두고, 크레딧 누락은 차이로 적는다.`\nAlso, `역할을 번역하거나…바꾸지 않는다` conflicts with \"모든 출력은 한국어\", whose only exception covers excerpts.\nReplace the Korean-output exception with: `단, 원문 발췌와 원래 역할 문자열은 원문 언어 그대로 적고 한국어 풀이를 붙인다.`\n\n**Objection D (a headless producer can't follow it).** `결과(열람·실패·미시도)를 ①에 적는다` makes the search mandatory, yet offers no outcome for \"searched, found nothing\". The producer will log that as 실패 or 미시도, or settle for a weak hit.\nReplace with: `결과(열람·실패·검색했으나 후보 없음)를 ①에 적고, 시도하지 못했으면 미시도와 그 이유를 적는다.`\n\nOut of scope: closing the source-type list (A-11), the reception-info rule (A-13) and the sample-limit wording \"0~2개\" (A-14) are left out, as intended."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":13090,"cache_read_input_tokens":1807,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":13090},"output_tokens":5,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"e6945986-fb01-4847-b0ce-2e858be36b1c","uuid":"2f754c0e-bdea-400a-854c-35edff6e33a9","timestamp":"2026-10-16T08:54:00.850Z","request_id":"req_011Cg5dfhDZL5qC1saAtHDwA"}
